# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/target/

# Generated/cached state (docs/plan/01_SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md §6): source +
# lockfile + immutable external assets are canonical; everything under a
# .aicad-cache/ directory is a disposable, content-addressed cache and must
# never be committed.
.aicad-cache/
**/.aicad-cache/

# Native build directories (native/occt_bridge and any future bridge),
# plus the root CMake build directory (root CMakeLists.txt, AICAD-015,
# only wires up native/occt_bridge — its default out-of-tree build dir
# lands at the repo root, not under native/)
/build/
native/**/build/
native/**/cmake-build*/

# Editor/OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
*.iml

# Local environment overrides — never commit secrets/local config
.env
.env.local
